{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10079","headline":"岭下卧疾寄刘长卿员外 · 包佶","name":"岭下卧疾寄刘长卿员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唯有贫兼病，能令亲爱疎。\n岁时供放逐，身世付空虚。\n胫弱秋添絮，头风晓废梳。\n波澜喧衆口，藜藿静吾庐。\n丧马思开卦，占鴞嬾发书。\n十年江海隔，离恨子知予。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}